adges, with working time grouped by root [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]parent[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]On every canonical daily note the Day strip sits above the bob-plan[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]badges, and its full-width working-time bar, grouped by root parent[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](top-level project, or the area a task lives in), separates it from[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]them. The stats dash defaults to the same root-parent grouping, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]with sub-project detail one click away. The rollup frontmatter key [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and the `## Pomodoros` heading total are retired. Four new glossary[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]strands name the concepts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]day_strip_above_badges_root_parents.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/day_strip_above_badges_root_parents.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-c5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-c5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire rollup frontmatter in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]retire-rollup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire-rollup: delete rollup parsing, selection, lints, catalog counts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the projects-list marker from bob-cli; rename the pre-rollup chain [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the residence chain; update vectors, H-vectors, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The root_parent dimension in bob stats[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]root-dimension[dim] · [dim][/dim]after retire-rollup[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]root-dimension: derive each home's root parent in the resolver and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report an additive root_parent parts dimension and catalog field for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro and task metrics, with human output, tests, docs, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]performance check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Day strip above the badges with a full-width root-parent bar[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip-above[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip-above: host the strip as the bob-plan block's first child, add the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-width bar row under a legend and meta row, prefer root_parent parts[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with an area fallback, and extend the preview harness and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stats dash Root parents view and plugin rollup removal[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stats-roots[dim] · [dim][/dim]after root-dimension, strip-above[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats-roots: replace Areas & projects with a Root parents view grouped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]by area with sub-project disclosure, route the strip's hand-off to it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drop rollup from the JS home mirror, and refresh fixtures and previews.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Contract docs, heading total cleanup, glossary strands[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]closeout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after stats-roots[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]closeout: rewrite the Day strip and Stats block contract in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/stats.md, remove the heading total per the decision, add the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary strands, and settle memory beads bob-cli-bt and bob-cli-bs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-c5","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-c5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-f58dfdf75b414e4aa4c85f6e0d420148","started_at":"2026-10-25T14:30:02.318126+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"34d4606b25412833d90d9e44fedb3665bb6153b5d86c15ca177ed94c4e42b506","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"ab190d0739a39c3270438dd8184a268826f752428bebed69f8d9e1261dafd8ff","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land/meta.json","size_bytes":716},"prompt":{"digest":"76dd3f1c48124b0874a3de90e687ac79da7209d90e17608426cac576e32c184d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":309},"state":{"digest":"97c875cb76835b0d0b40d710ba97126ec147512f1cc8c339e257f53a1fb4e8dc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-c5.land","local_name":"bob-cli-c5.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-c5","agent_clan_generation":"20261025102840","bead_id":"bob-cli-c5","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-c5","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-c5.1","bob-cli-c5.2","bob-cli-c5.3","bob-cli-c5.4","bob-cli-c5.5"]},"source_run_id":"run-ffd1599a5c882a6111fd12864761754e","started_at":"20261025102845","state":"waiting"}],"